SUMMARY:IU Cinema Volunteer Usher Orientation
DESCRIPTION:Be a part of the team at IU Cinema by becoming a member of th
 e volunteer Usher Corps! As a volunteer usher\, you assure our patrons ha
 ve an exceptional experience. Sometimes that means greeting patrons warml
 y\, tearing their tickets\, and handing out programs. Other times\, you w
 ill answer questions about the Cinema and its programming\, address patro
 n feedback\, or ensure patron comfort and safety during screenings. The f
 irst step is to fill out the application here (https://iu.co1.qualtrics.c
 om/jfe/form/SV_73V0GmspAaPf1DD)\, and then attend an orientation session 
 like this one!  If you'd like to apply but can't attend this particular s
 ession\, there will also be orientations on August 29 at 12:30pm and Sept
 ember 18 at 3:30pm. Each session is 90 minutes.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Be a part of the team at IU Cinema by b
 ecoming a member of the volunteer Usher Corps! As a volunteer usher\, you
  assure our patrons have an exceptional experience. Sometimes that means 
 greeting patrons warmly\, tearing their tickets\, and handing out program
 s. Other times\, you will answer questions about the Cinema and its progr
 amming\, address patron feedback\, or ensure patron comfort and safety du
 ring screenings. The first step is to fill out the application <a class="
 external" href="https://iu.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_73V0GmspAaPf1DD"
 >here</a>\, and then attend an orientation session like this one!</p><p> 
  If you'd like to apply but can't attend this particular session\, there 
 will also be orientations on August 29 at 12:30pm and September 18 at 3:3
 0pm. Each session is 90 minutes.</p>
