BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:IU Cinema
DTSTART:20260924T230000Z
DTEND:20260925T000000Z
LOCATION:IU CINEMA
GEO:39.168613;-86.517376
SUMMARY:Reality Bites | Soundtracks of a Generation
DESCRIPTION:This irreverent look at the harsh realities of life after col
 lege captures the misadventures of Lelaina (Winona Ryder)\, an aspiring T
 V production assistant and burgeoning reality-television creator\, and he
 r relationships with her sarcastic roommate Vickie (Janeane Garofalo)\, f
 riends Sammy (Steve Zahn) and Troy (Ethan Hawke)\, and an ambitious video
  executive\, Michael (Ben Stiller). Reality Bites captures that nebulous 
 period between college and the rest of your life with an endless supply o
 f evergreen quotes about life\, love\, and the pursuit of gainful employm
 ent. Premiering at the Sundance Film Festival in 1994\, smack-dab in the 
 midst of the fest's indie filmmaking heyday\, and riding high on the '70s
  nostalgia of the '90s\, Reality Bites and its accompanying soundtrack is
  a comedic and cultural touchstone encapsulating Generation X's slacker/g
 rind culture with pitch perfection. [99 min\; comedy\, drama\; English]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  This irreverent look at the harsh reali
 ties of life after college captures the misadventures of Lelaina (Winona 
 Ryder)\, an aspiring TV production assistant and burgeoning reality-telev
 ision creator\, and her relationships with her sarcastic roommate Vickie 
 (Janeane Garofalo)\, friends Sammy (Steve Zahn) and Troy (Ethan Hawke)\, 
 and an ambitious video executive\, Michael (Ben Stiller). <i>Reality Bite
 s</i> captures that nebulous period between college and the rest of your 
 life with an endless supply of evergreen quotes about life\, love\, and t
 he pursuit of gainful employment. Premiering at the Sundance Film Festiva
 l in 1994\, smack-dab in the midst of the fest's indie filmmaking heyday\
 , and riding high on the '70s nostalgia of the '90s\, <i>Reality Bites</i
 > and its accompanying soundtrack is a comedic and cultural touchstone en
 capsulating Generation X's slacker/grind culture with pitch perfection. [
 99 min\; comedy\, drama\; English]</p>
