SUMMARY:Cronos | Friday Night Frights
DESCRIPTION:Antiques dealer Jesús Gris stumbles across Cronos\, a 400-ye
 ar-old scarab that\, when it latches onto him\, grants him youth\, eterna
 l life—and a thirst for blood. As Jesús enjoys his newfound vitality\,
  he's unaware that a dying old man has sent his nephew to find the scarab
  and bring it back to him. But Jesús will not give immortality up easily
 . [94 min\; horror\; Spanish with English subtitles]
